2026-11-13T00:53:00.4718945Z   by a product-owned sidecar whose sha256 pins the committed bytes; nothing
2026-11-13T00:53:00.4719402Z   may cite it as an audit gate, and no /audit ref for 40278460732 exists;
2026-11-13T00:53:00.4719834Z * state attribution is repaired: ``current_cycle_run_id`` names the
2026-11-13T00:53:00.4720278Z   EXECUTING run (40284658455), not the resumed snapshot (40283048553's state
2026-11-13T00:53:00.4720651Z   rewrite had regressed to 40278460732);
2026-11-13T00:53:00.4721024Z * the accepted pointer still satisfies BOTH halves of requirement 4 and the
