2026-11-13T00:53:37.7631112Z def workflow_validation(
2026-11-13T00:53:37.7631338Z     direction_version: int,
2026-11-13T00:53:37.7631579Z     state_path: Path = CANONICAL_STATE,
2026-11-13T00:53:37.7631842Z ) -> tuple[bool, str]:
2026-11-13T00:53:37.7632156Z     """Exact Python equivalent of ``Validate active MVP producer state``.
2026-11-13T00:53:37.7632452Z 
2026-11-13T00:53:37.7632639Z     Returns ``(ok, message)``. ``ok=False`` means the workflow would exit 69.
2026-11-13T00:53:37.7632994Z     """
